<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl">
  <p class="system-tag mb-3">// SYSTEM MESSAGE</p>

  <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl text-ember-400 leading-tight">
    You Have Been Selected<br>For Entry.
  </h1>

  <p class="mt-6 text-parchment-dim text-lg leading-relaxed">
    Somewhere below the surface, a dungeon is waking up &mdash; and the cameras are
    already rolling. Create a crawler, sign the waiver nobody reads, and find out
    how far you get before the floor decides to eat you.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
    <%= link_to "Create Your Crawler", new_registration_path, class: "btn-torch px-6 py-3 rounded text-sm" %>
    <%= link_to "Continue Your Run", new_session_path, class: "text-parchment-dim hover:text-arcane-400 underline underline-offset-4" %>
  </div>

  <div class="panel mt-14 rounded-lg p-6">
    <p class="system-tag mb-4">Rules Of Engagement</p>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-parchment">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-arcane-400 font-system">01</span> The dungeon is always watching. So is everyone else.</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-arcane-400 font-system">02</span> Every crawler gets one waiver, one login, and no refunds.</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-arcane-400 font-system">03</span> Death is a setback, not an ending. Probably.</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-arcane-400 font-system">04</span> The System is always right, even when it's lying.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
